{"key":"Passives_Enemy-twth.json|/dataList/8/flavor","kr_sha":"aeee6788d8c737b2f3bff747047f01e46fe3871139edec9b3dbfe2429fc47b19","zh":"「各位知道指令會由諸多形式傳達吧。由紙片傳達是其中最常見的，也有許多人喜歡如此。」","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
