{"key":"Passives_Enemy-twth.json|/dataList/9/desc","kr_sha":"f9c8dd3150ad1b9e607beb555d0b87f6a9334778c31358ec49473b862cb53706","zh":"若本回合自身執行了 [IndexPrescript_Base]：\n則回合結束時，使自身恢復5點理智值並獲得2層 [BlessingOfIndexPrescriptEnemy] (每回合最多1次)\n- 若自身帶有 [IndexPrescriptEnemy_2] 或執行 [IndexPrescript_Base] 時目標帶有 [IndexPrescriptTargetToPersonality]，\n則改為恢復10點理智值並獲得3層 [BlessingOfIndexPrescriptEnemy]\n\n若本回合自身未執行 [IndexPrescript_Base]，\n則回合結束時對自身施加10層 [KarmaOfIndexEnemy]\n- 若自身的 [BlessingOfIndexPrescriptEnemy] 不高於6層，則使自身獲得1層 [BlessingOfIndexPrescriptEnemy]\n- 若自身的 [BlessingOfIndexPrescriptEnemy] 層數為9層，則不會施加 [KarmaOfIndexEnemy]","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"Passives_Enemy-twth.json|/dataList/9/flavor","kr_sha":"12c06df3f620a55aafe7d5be806905ec271543b2d45c48856c9faf84a7f26df8","zh":"「那麼……傳達指令的方式……究竟有多少種呢？其多樣性是否都源於同一根源？又或是不同的傳達方式存在個別的主體？」\n「探求這些便是我們食指研究會的責任。請問您要入會嗎？」","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"Passives_Enemy-twth.json|/dataList/9/name","kr_sha":"2772e5e7cbf4ee6e6747944190daf44aa09359a070c901d502d6d5212b3b5e5a","zh":"指令之意","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"Passives_Enemy-twth.json|/dataList/10/desc","kr_sha":"fb8d40c9d41dd55bc7953a8edd30989e1c19a3545a39fe8d3fe52a1be9bd1fa1","zh":"自身每帶有1層 [BlessingOfIndexPrescriptEnemy]，則使自身對 [IndexPrescriptTargetToPersonality] 造成的傷害+2.5%(最多+20%)\n- 若自身的 [BlessingOfIndexPrescriptEnemy] 層數為9層，則改為對全體目標造成的傷害+30%\n\n命中帶有 [IndexPrescriptTargetToPersonality] 的目標時，\n使自身增加1級 [Breath] 強度並使目標增加1級 [Sinking] 強度(每回合最多1次)\n- 自身每帶有3層 [BlessingOfIndexPrescriptEnemy]，使該效果每回合可觸發的次數+1(最多+2)","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"Passives_Enemy-twth.json|/dataList/10/flavor","kr_sha":"4b424ce20b96e28bf028a47421074d4bd669d40a7143d95f3d45459e7bce8eda","zh":"一柄看似平庸的劍。\n這柄劍在遵循指令、自陰影處現身的傳令者協助，以及代行者們的教導，逐漸成為一柄具有個性、獨樹一格的劍。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
